  "description": "With his family slain and village destroyed, Korvald is branded a heretic and seemingly condemned to death, but the truth of his torment is part of a bigger and more sinister agenda! Join forces with beautiful warrior nuns, alluring mythical figures and interdimensional creatures to prevent our world from being devoured. Can you contain your primal urges and fight to survive?\n\nBook of Korvald is a side-scrolling 2D action-adventure where each chapter takes place across an entire country, spanning more than 30 areas of Scandinavia and beyond. Control Korvald as he makes key decisions, encounters dozens of memorable characters and wields a huge variety of weapons against his foes, from axes and swords to whips and maces! Use runes to unleash powerful elemental spells or summon creatures to assist you. Customize your skills to match your playstyle and face off against 30 unique bosses!\n\n• Explore 30 stages as a condemned Norse scribe!\n• Wield various weapon types in real-time combat.\n• Unlock and upgrade skills across an expansive talent tree!\n• Engage in mini-games, from fishing and farming to drinking contests and arena battles.\n• Meet dozens of female companions and other unique NPCs!",
